{"messages":[{"text":"🇮🇱 Miki Zohar, ministro de Cultura de Israel, pide retirar la nacionalidad a los directores de 'NAZA', documental premiado en Venecia sobre civiles muertos en Gaza.\n🌶️ Cultura, según Zohar: si la película molesta, que el pasaporte pague la entrada.","buttons":[{"label":"Abrir en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AE%F0%9F%87%B1%20Miki%20Zohar%2C%20ministro%20de%20Cultura%20de%20Israel%2C%20pide%20retirar%20la%20nacionalidad%20a%20los%20directores%20de%20%27NAZA%27%2C%20documental%20premiado%20en%20Venecia%20sobre%20civiles%20muertos%20en%20Gaza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Cultura%2C%20seg%C3%BAn%20Zohar%3A%20si%20la%20pel%C3%ADcula%20molesta%2C%20que%20el%20pasaporte%20pague%20la%20entrada."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 1 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AE%F0%9F%87%B1%20Miki%20Zohar%2C%20ministro%20de%20Cultura%20de%20Israel%2C%20pide%20retirar%20la%20nacionalidad%20a%20los%20directores%20de%20%27NAZA%27%2C%20documental%20premiado%20en%20Venecia%20sobre%20civiles%20muertos%20en%20Gaza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20Zohar%20vio%20un%20documental%20inc%C3%B3modo%20y%20eligi%C3%B3%20cr%C3%ADtica%20oficial%3A%20quitar%20la%20ciudadan%C3%ADa."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 2 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AE%F0%9F%87%B1%20Miki%20Zohar%2C%20ministro%20de%20Cultura%20de%20Israel%2C%20pide%20retirar%20la%20nacionalidad%20a%20los%20directores%20de%20%27NAZA%27%2C%20documental%20premiado%20en%20Venecia%20sobre%20civiles%20muertos%20en%20Gaza.%0A%F0%9F%8C%B6%EF%B8%8F%20%27NAZA%27%20gana%20en%20Venecia%20y%20Zohar%20propone%20premio%20extra%3A%20perder%20la%20nacionalidad."},{"label":"Abrir alt. 3 en X","url":"https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=%F0%9F%87%AE%F0%9F%87%B1%20Miki%20Zohar%2C%20ministro%20de%20Cultura%20de%20Israel%2C%20pide%20retirar%20la%20nacionalidad%20a%20los%20directores%20de%20%27NAZA%27%2C%20documental%20premiado%20en%20Venecia%20sobre%20civiles%20muertos%20en%20Gaza.%0A%F